4	/*
5	 * TownSquare Tycoon – Command Manager
6	 * -----------------------------------
7	 * Central place for routing gameplay commands, handling
8	 * undo/redo stacks, and preparing commands for
9	 * network-sync or replay feeds.
10	 *
11	 * The module embraces the Command Pattern while being
12	 * deliberately framework-agnostic.  It is expected to be
13	 * consumed by both the client-side simulation and the
14	 * authoritative server (for small community-hosted
15	 * shards).
